{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"The Tori Spelling case doesn't fit (Liam born March 13, 2007; Stella born June 9, 2008 — different days). Let me reconsider the clues. The \"novel narrator\" is key. Famous novel narrators include: Scout (To Kill a Mockingbird), Nick (The Great Gatsby), Holden (Catcher in the Rye), Pip (Great Expectations), Humbert (Lolita), Offred (The Handmaid's Tale), Ishmael (Moby-Dick). Let me search for a couple whose second child shares a name with a novel narrator and was born on the same day as the first.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"second child born same day as first child named Scout\", \"baby named Scout born same birthday as sibling\", \"couple two children born same date named after novel narrator\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_c3bce8e4de0c4fcc987fa8a1","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"second baby born same day as first baby named Pip\", \"baby named Pip same birthday older sibling\", \"couple children born same day named Pip Scout Nick Holden\"], \"top_k\": 5}","name":"search"},"id":"call_222e0c08b0e448f1868aa694","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789482548,"id":"chatcmpl-2af8a169-a108-99fa-a366-4cd04e9efaa2","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19338,"completion_tokens":237,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":19575,"cached_tokens":13440,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":13440},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}